# Deploy to Render

This app is live at https://nomige-meshin.onrender.com (GitHub: `Ushijima24/nomige-meshin`, branch `master`). Render deploys from GitHub.

After completing user-requested changes in this repo:

1. Commit the relevant files (do not wait to be asked).
2. Push to `origin/master` so Render redeploys.
3. Tell the user when the push is done; Render may take a minute to go live.

Do not leave finished UI/game fixes only on the local machine.
